    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e<strong>Clumsy Witch</strong> is a whimsical yet strategic rogue-lite deckbuilder where you step into the shoes of a hopelessly clumsy apprentice witch on a mission to pass her magical final exam. Your only hope? A chaotic mix of elemental spell cards and magical little creatures called <strong>Chibis</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel the powers of <strong>Fire</strong>, <strong>Water</strong>, <strong>Earth</strong>, and <strong>Air</strong> to craft powerful combos. Build your deck, experiment with synergies, and unlock evolving strategies as you progress through randomized stages. Just don't drop your wand again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab <strong>Chibi Companions</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect adorable, passive-effect Chibis\u2014each one offers unique bonuses based on your playstyle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet conditions to <strong>evolve</strong> Chibis into more powerful versions with stronger effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically build your Chibi lineup like Jokers in <i>Balatro</i> to maximize synergy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Elemental Combos</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play elemental cards in clever combinations: three of a kind, opposites, full sets, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new combo formulas and increase your <strong>Element Power</strong> to earn higher scores.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf93 <strong>Witch Exam Awaits</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise through increasingly difficult stages, each with new rules and random challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new cards, Chibis, and relics that change the way you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, learn, adapt\u2014and try again. Even the best witches fall off their broom a few times!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love cute chaos, strategic deckbuilding, and chasing the perfect combo run, <i>Clumsy Witch</i> is ready to put your spellcraft to the test!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e<strong>Clumsy Witch</strong> is a whimsical yet strategic rogue-lite deckbuilder where you step into the shoes of a hopelessly clumsy apprentice witch on a mission to pass her magical final exam. Your only hope? A chaotic mix of elemental spell cards and magical little creatures called <strong>Chibis</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel the powers of <strong>Fire</strong>, <strong>Water</strong>, <strong>Earth</strong>, and <strong>Air</strong> to craft powerful combos. Build your deck, experiment with synergies, and unlock evolving strategies as you progress through randomized stages. Just don't drop your wand again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcab <strong>Chibi Companions</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect adorable, passive-effect Chibis\u2014each one offers unique bonuses based on your playstyle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet conditions to <strong>evolve</strong> Chibis into more powerful versions with stronger effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically build your Chibi lineup like Jokers in <i>Balatro</i> to maximize synergy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Elemental Combos</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play elemental cards in clever combinations: three of a kind, opposites, full sets, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new combo formulas and increase your <strong>Element Power</strong> to earn higher scores.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf93 <strong>Witch Exam Awaits</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise through increasingly difficult stages, each with new rules and random challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new cards, Chibis, and relics that change the way you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, learn, adapt\u2014and try again. Even the best witches fall off their broom a few times!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love cute chaos, strategic deckbuilding, and chasing the perfect combo run, <i>Clumsy Witch</i> is ready to put your spellcraft to the test!</p>",
